  "lyrics": [
    {
      "section_id": "section_0",
      "type": "intro",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "\"Even then I had the uneasy feeling it wasn't young Viktor Vaughn who would need my protection\"",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Motherfuckers, that's why I ain't playin' with their ass, that's what's gon' happen to them niggas",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Motherfuckers done fucked up, man",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Ain't it some shit like that?",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABCB",
      "rhyme_vowel": "ABCB"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Yo, I'm only rhyming where the drums is at",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Y'all niggas think y'all slick with that bullshit—bump that",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Y'all pay V for flowing to the beat",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Not for what he know that got hoes hoeing in the streets",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "That's for him to know and for they to never find out",
          "rhyme": "awt",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "About the kidnap, blindfold and the blind mouse",
          "rhyme": "uz",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "The coroner report say he simply signed out",
          "rhyme": "awt",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Oh, and I know, y'all wanna see a wino? Bring the wine out",
          "rhyme": "awt",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "Cat with a dead mouse is how he catch a phrase, and pause plays with it",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "Kill it, and eat off it for days, get it",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "Whoever ain't get it ain't supposed to",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "For standing still close to, bandits will ghost you",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "No shoot, Sherlock, I don't know how they do on your block",
          "rhyme": "Ok",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "Out here we rock on to the sure shot",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "Shit still ain't stop, keep it on 'til your peeps is gone",
          "rhyme": "on",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "V be on the creep, no matter what you keep it on",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "CD, debahh—oh—",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "AABBCDCCBBEFGEHIE",
      "rhyme_vowel": "AABBACAABBDCEDDFD"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_2",
      "type": "interlude",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Aw—Y'all motherfuckers",
          "rhyme": "9R",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Playin'",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Motherfu—",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABC",
      "rhyme_vowel": "ABC"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_3",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "V, he catch the beat too ridiculously",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "People think he study levitation's true mystery",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Had a pal named Ed Leedskalnin until he got him for his Sweet Sixteen",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "He said Ed be Wilin'",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Rumor has it things got violent",
          "rhyme": "Ol",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "He clobbered him and broke the fuck out, but he ain't try to rob him",
          "rhyme": "im",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "I told her don't tell your man, that's the trouble with these chicks",
          "rhyme": "ik",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Next experiment: Twelve strands from double helix",
          "rhyme": "iks",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "No I haven't seen Kes, Neelix",
          "rhyme": "iks",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "\"Oh, yeah? Just you stay away from her with those lyrics.\"",
          "rhyme": "ik",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "Please—ain't nobody fuckin' after her",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "I'm out of here as soon as I fix the flux capacitor",
          "rhyme": "OR",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "And oh, and speak to V in a proper manner",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "Before he stabs you and put out all types of propaganda",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "Stop the slander, chop the hand of a thief",
          "rhyme": "Ef",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "And cut the mouth off of whoever come out their teeth",
          "rhyme": "Et",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "V sell time to an inmate",
          "rhyme": "at",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "And then tell him a rhyme for the hell of it to demonstrate",
          "rhyme": "at",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "18",
          "text": "They know who's the renown beat critic",
          "rhyme": "ik",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "19",
          "text": "And do a street lyric like, \"That's a neat trick!\"",
          "rhyme": "ik",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "20",
          "text": "Off on a tangent, they ain't got a cent",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "21",
          "text": "Supposed to went to management, and spent it getting bent",
          "rhyme": "yRb",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "22",
          "text": "Sparky, I had enough of your malarkey",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "23",
          "text": "For one, don't mark me and who you calling Darkie?",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "AABCDEFGGFHIHJKLMMFFNOPA",
      "rhyme_vowel": "AAABCAAAAADCDEFFEEAAGHFA"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_4",
      "type": "outro",
      "performer": "",
